  "body": "This PR contains the following updates:\n\n| Package | Update | Change |\n|---|---|---|\n| [github/gh-actions-lock](https://redirect.github.com/github/gh-actions-lock) | patch | `v0.5.0` → `v0.5.1` |\n\n---\n\n### Release Notes\n\n<details>\n<summary>github/gh-actions-lock</summary>\n\n### [`v0.5.1`](https://redirect.github.com/github/gh-actions-lock/releases/tag/v0.5.1): gh-actions-lock 0.5.1\n\n[Compare Source](https://redirect.github.com/github/gh-actions-lock/compare/v0.5.0...v0.5.1)\n\n#### What's Changed\n\n- Run from .github/workflows by moving to the repo root by [@&#8203;jessehouwing](https://redirect.github.com/jessehouwing) in [#&#8203;291](https://redirect.github.com/github/gh-actions-lock/pull/291)\n- Rewrite a full-SHA use a composite also declares on the first run by [@&#8203;nodeselector](https://redirect.github.com/nodeselector) in [#&#8203;312](https://redirect.github.com/github/gh-actions-lock/pull/312)\n\n#### Contributors\n\nThank you to everyone who reported, fixed and tested things for this release:\n\n- Code: [@&#8203;jessehouwing](https://redirect.github.com/jessehouwing) ([#&#8203;291](https://redirect.github.com/github/gh-actions-lock/pull/291))\n- Reports: [@&#8203;jessehouwing](https://redirect.github.com/jessehouwing), [@&#8203;woodruffw](https://redirect.github.com/woodruffw)\n\n**Full Changelog**: <https://github.com/github/gh-actions-lock/compare/v0.5.0...v0.5.1>\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n### Configuration\n\n📅 **Schedule**: (UTC)\n\n- Branch creation\n  - At any time (no schedule defined)\n- Automerge\n  - At any time (no schedule defined)\n\n🚦 **Automerge**: Disabled by config. Please merge this manually once you are satisfied.\n\n♻ **Rebasing**: Whenever PR becomes conflicted, or you tick the rebase/retry checkbox.\n\n🔕 **Ignore**: Close this PR and you won't be reminded about this update again.\n\n---\n\n - [ ] <!-- rebase-check -->If you want to rebase/retry this PR, check this box\n\n---\n\nThis PR was generated by [Mend Renovate](https://mend.io/renovate/). View the [repository job log](https://developer.mend.io/github/home-assistant/builder).\n<!--renovate-debug:eyJjcmVhdGVkSW5WZXIiOiI0NC4yNDkuMSIsInVwZGF0ZWRJblZlciI6IjQ0LjI0OS4xIiwidGFyZ2V0QnJhbmNoIjoibWFzdGVyIiwibGFiZWxzIjpbImRlcGVuZGVuY2llcyIsImdpdGh1Yl9hY3Rpb25zIl19-->\n",
